  "ui.build.help": "<b>Build</b><br>Pick a template for your class and follow \"What to do now\": up to 3 steps, each with its button. Below, progress by area (tap one to see the detail). Green check: done; gold box: missing.<br><span class=\"k\">EDIT PLAN</span> (advanced): add and remove goals by hand, with everything below.<br><span class=\"k\">TEMPLATE</span>: a ready-made plan for your class.<br><span class=\"k\">{star} Your build</span>: marks in the shop, the inventory and fusion what helps the plan.<br>When a goal advances a notice appears (turn it off in Settings › Game › Build notices).<br><span class=\"k\">ATTRIBUTES</span>: e.g. STR 40; when you level up it reminds you where to put the points. APPLY SUGGESTION adds as goals the suggested split for your free points and those of the next levels.<br><span class=\"k\">TREE</span>: mark notables and keystones; + PATHS adds the nodes that connect them.<br><span class=\"k\">ASCENSION</span>: one of the 2 for your class and its nodes.<br><span class=\"k\">WEAPON</span>: type or base, mods with minimum tier and passive. <span class=\"k\">+ TARGET WEAPON</span>: search any base and build the full weapon; the % compares your inventory and the stash (marked STASH, never moves on its own) and says what you are missing.<br><span class=\"k\">ULT AND FEATS</span>: the active ULT, its upgrades and the feats you are after.<br>Hover a goal to see what is missing.",
